WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:07.799
[moody, intense intro music plays]

01:08.777 --> 01:09.778
Hey!

01:10.487 --> 01:14.157
Dong-eun! I'm so sorry
we didn't get a chance to talk back there.

01:14.240 --> 01:17.911
[laughing] It's too funny,
running into you out here.

01:17.994 --> 01:18.995
Great seeing you.

01:21.039 --> 01:23.666
Can… we talk real quick? Huh?

01:27.128 --> 01:28.213
Okay.

01:29.339 --> 01:30.173
This way.

01:54.781 --> 01:57.659
Please spare me.
Please spare me just once.

01:57.742 --> 02:01.079
I've made a lot of mistakes,
and I have no excuses.

02:01.162 --> 02:03.123
I won't ask you to understand.

02:03.206 --> 02:04.791
I'm incredibly sorry.

02:05.583 --> 02:09.170
I've been repenting my whole life,
and I won't stop. I swear, Dong-eun.

02:09.879 --> 02:11.464
Why are you kneeling already?

02:11.548 --> 02:13.800
I haven't even
gotten started with you yet.

02:14.300 --> 02:15.385
This is supposed to be easy.

02:15.969 --> 02:19.013
I was a child.
My family had nothing, you know?

02:19.514 --> 02:21.850
I really didn't want to do it,
but then they all…

02:22.350 --> 02:24.602
[shudders] I didn't have a choice.

02:25.186 --> 02:26.938
And we were all so young back then.

02:27.021 --> 02:29.858
We all make mistakes
when we're growing up, don't we, Dong-eun?

02:30.358 --> 02:33.653
Well, okay then.
Tell me if this is a mistake.

02:39.200 --> 02:41.035
[screams, pants]

02:41.119 --> 02:42.287
[menacing music plays]

02:42.370 --> 02:43.580
I'm a flight attendant!

02:43.663 --> 02:45.248
Are you crazy?

02:49.794 --> 02:52.881
This here is what you call "malice,"
Ms. Flight Attendant.

02:54.048 --> 02:56.551
When you're trying to hurt someone
and you know it.

02:57.677 --> 02:59.721
And you did that to me every day.

03:05.185 --> 03:10.148
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
I've done something really terrible.

03:10.231 --> 03:11.608
But, please, Dong-eun,

03:12.567 --> 03:14.819
can't you please forgive me,
just this once?

03:15.445 --> 03:17.864
Please don't tell my mother-in-law
about what happened.

03:17.947 --> 03:19.199
Just stop contacting her.

03:19.782 --> 03:21.784
Just until I get married, please.

03:23.536 --> 03:26.080
I've already resigned,
so if I can't make this marriage work,

03:26.164 --> 03:28.791
I won't have any income,
and I could actually die from this!

03:28.875 --> 03:30.293
[wails]

03:31.753 --> 03:34.088
You tried your best to change your tune,

03:34.172 --> 03:36.007
but it was too fast and too clumsy.

03:36.090 --> 03:38.551
I never planned
on getting anything from you.

03:38.635 --> 03:40.261
Money, or an apology.

03:40.845 --> 03:43.097
Now you try to ask for my pity.

03:43.598 --> 03:45.016
You've tried to threaten me.

03:45.600 --> 03:47.101
What's your next great idea?

03:50.897 --> 03:51.898
Shit.

03:53.149 --> 03:54.025
What do you want?

03:55.026 --> 03:56.110
What now?

03:56.194 --> 03:58.488
What do you want from me now,
you psychotic fuck?

04:00.990 --> 04:02.367
You lost your phone, didn't you?

04:08.998 --> 04:11.000
[tense, mysterious music playing]

04:16.130 --> 04:19.509
That's it. That's the phone you lost.

04:19.592 --> 04:20.843
It was you?

04:21.344 --> 04:23.388
Myeong-o didn't send me those pictures?

04:24.347 --> 04:25.598
You're crazy!

04:25.682 --> 04:27.433
Just think, huh?

04:27.517 --> 04:30.520
Think about how much more
I know about you after looking at that.

04:30.603 --> 04:31.604
[gasps]

04:32.272 --> 04:36.192
There's only one way to save yourself,
so think about it long and hard.

04:36.276 --> 04:37.694
It's what you do best.

04:38.569 --> 04:41.781
So, I don't have to
meet with your mother-in-law.

04:48.705 --> 04:53.001
I am gonna be on your side
until the day I die, Dong-eun.

04:55.128 --> 04:56.587
What do you want to do first?

05:01.342 --> 05:02.260
First, Myeong-o.

05:03.636 --> 05:05.013
Report the bastard missing.

05:15.273 --> 05:16.274
[man] Hello.

05:20.278 --> 05:21.279
[woman] Thank you.

05:47.805 --> 05:48.973
Look straight ahead.

05:54.520 --> 05:57.190
-[engine turns over]
-[classical music playing in car]

06:01.736 --> 06:03.321
Do you have something to say?

06:03.404 --> 06:06.699
Oh, no. It's just nice
to see kids laughing.

06:06.783 --> 06:08.993
It's like watching some cheesy commercial.

06:09.827 --> 06:11.454
I don't plan on getting married.

06:11.537 --> 06:13.664
Married men get
the short end of the stick.

06:14.957 --> 06:18.878
The same exact things are romance
before marriage, but cheating afterwards.

06:18.961 --> 06:20.963
-Right?
-Watch it, there are kids here.

06:21.047 --> 06:22.757
Wow, you're a great father, huh?

06:22.840 --> 06:25.676
[chuckles] But you're not that much fun.

06:27.470 --> 06:29.639
Ye-sol has such a great sense of humor.

06:31.182 --> 06:32.600
Wonder where she got that.

06:34.268 --> 06:35.478
[menacing music playing]

06:35.561 --> 06:39.565
-Tell me what exactly you're trying to do.
-Oh man, you're so intimidating.

06:41.359 --> 06:42.860
There are kids here, you know?

06:48.241 --> 06:49.158
Well, then.

06:50.576 --> 06:51.828
I have to see an old friend.

06:56.916 --> 06:59.794
Oh, you reach Myeong-o yet?

07:03.297 --> 07:04.632
I don't need to anymore.

07:05.675 --> 07:07.385
I found out the reason why today.

07:08.428 --> 07:09.429
[car door closes]

07:21.315 --> 07:23.359
[menacing music continuing]

07:31.242 --> 07:32.827
[Myeong-o] Can you stand there?

07:32.910 --> 07:35.580
I'll kill you if you move your hand.
Stay right there.

07:51.220 --> 07:53.431
Lower your hands! I'm going to kill you.

07:53.514 --> 07:54.515
[door opens]

07:54.599 --> 07:57.351
[teacher] Hey, which homeroom are you in?
The bell rang hours ago!

07:57.435 --> 07:58.811
Oh shit. Fuck.

08:06.736 --> 08:10.031
I guess you drink a lot of milk, huh?
You can stop drinking now.

08:10.114 --> 08:11.115
[Jae-jun chuckles]

08:12.366 --> 08:15.745
[Myeong-o] I was right, wasn't I?
Dong-eun's boobs are fucking huge!

08:18.748 --> 08:19.832
[whimpering]

08:24.670 --> 08:26.672
[music trails off]

08:28.966 --> 08:29.967
Hey there, Dong-eun.

08:34.347 --> 08:36.891
So it looks like
Yeon-jin's pretty little pet

08:36.974 --> 08:38.935
is her daughter's homeroom teacher now.

08:41.354 --> 08:42.188
Coincidence?

08:43.940 --> 08:45.608
I guess Yeon-jin didn't tell you.

08:46.859 --> 08:48.653
I told her that it was not.

08:51.364 --> 08:53.115
If it wasn't a coincidence, then…

08:55.785 --> 08:57.453
that means you've planned everything out

08:57.537 --> 08:59.121
from when we saw you in the gym

08:59.205 --> 09:00.915
to this moment right now.

09:04.335 --> 09:05.586
That's fucking scary.

09:08.130 --> 09:10.216
I didn't realize that you were like this.

09:11.926 --> 09:13.886
I thought you'd be
playing basketball or something.

09:13.970 --> 09:17.557
Huh. Tell me, why is it
that bad feelings are always right?

09:18.140 --> 09:19.475
[Jae-jun exhales heavily]

09:19.559 --> 09:21.477
I don't think I can avoid this,

09:21.561 --> 09:23.020
and I can't stop you.

09:24.939 --> 09:27.316
Will all this only end
when everyone's suffered?

09:29.151 --> 09:30.736
Like that long rainy day?

09:32.822 --> 09:33.990
[tense music playing]

09:34.073 --> 09:35.324
[chuckles]

09:36.284 --> 09:38.202
Hey, so you know how to get angry too?

09:39.996 --> 09:41.581
I wanted to see how much you've grown up.

09:41.664 --> 09:42.790
That's why I'm here.

09:44.125 --> 09:44.959
Oh, right.

09:45.960 --> 09:47.670
You have those scars, don't you?

09:49.088 --> 09:51.757
Did they all get better now?
Don't they feel hot?

09:55.803 --> 09:57.179
Answer my question, okay?

10:05.605 --> 10:07.440
Ah, it's still there.

10:07.523 --> 10:08.983
[disturbing music playing]

10:09.066 --> 10:09.984
[shudders]

10:12.778 --> 10:14.488
Let me make it all better.

10:16.574 --> 10:19.410
[exhales raspily]

10:23.289 --> 10:24.457
I'm warning you.

10:25.041 --> 10:27.043
Don't touch Yeon-jin's daughter

10:29.045 --> 10:30.004
in any way.

10:38.095 --> 10:39.930
So, did you get Ye-sol's toothbrush?

10:40.556 --> 10:43.267
I sent it to you… for urgent delivery.

10:44.977 --> 10:45.811
[Jae-jun scoffs]

10:48.064 --> 10:49.023
That was you?

10:49.607 --> 10:50.983
Let me warn you as well.

10:52.318 --> 10:54.737
Don't you help Park Yeon-jin
in any way, okay?

10:54.820 --> 10:55.821
[scoffs]

10:56.822 --> 10:59.533
If you really want Ye-sol,
then I'm your ally.

10:59.617 --> 11:00.951
Not Yeon-jin. All right?

11:03.621 --> 11:05.623
And you might not be aware of this,

11:07.249 --> 11:09.001
but I was somebody's daughter.

11:11.003 --> 11:11.962
Right, Jae-jun?

11:17.093 --> 11:18.094
[chuckles]

11:23.766 --> 11:25.184
My mom told me

11:27.228 --> 11:29.230
I should always listen to the teacher.

11:29.855 --> 11:30.856
[chuckles]

11:33.025 --> 11:34.151
It was great seeing you.

11:38.614 --> 11:39.699
This is for you.

11:47.665 --> 11:50.376
HA YE-SOL

12:00.886 --> 12:02.388
[vomiting]

12:09.770 --> 12:10.771
[panting heavily]

12:21.657 --> 12:23.659
[somber, sorrowful music playing]

12:36.756 --> 12:37.757
[weeping softly]

12:41.844 --> 12:42.845
[whimpering]

12:50.770 --> 12:52.938
A parents' day? Today?

12:53.022 --> 12:56.066
Yeah. There were
a lot of dads in the classroom,

12:56.150 --> 12:58.194
but Dad was for sure the coolest one.

12:58.277 --> 13:00.780
Ye-sol! Why do you
keep breaking your promise?

13:00.863 --> 13:02.531
I want to know everything about school,

13:02.615 --> 13:05.493
and everything that your teacher
says or does to you. Remember that?

13:05.576 --> 13:07.912
You should have told me about
something like that, Ye-sol!

13:08.496 --> 13:11.081
I told you when we were
eating dinner before.

13:11.832 --> 13:14.460
I said that all the dads
were coming one day.

13:15.211 --> 13:18.422
Oh, I'm just all over
the place these days. I'm sorry.

13:20.299 --> 13:22.551
Did your dad talk with your teacher
when he was there?

13:23.052 --> 13:24.053
Did they greet each other?

13:24.136 --> 13:25.638
No. They didn't.

13:25.721 --> 13:29.058
Oh, but Dad talked
with Uncle Jae-jun after class.

13:30.851 --> 13:33.604
Uncle Jae-jun was at school?
Why was he in your classroom, though?

13:41.987 --> 13:42.988
[sighs]

13:55.417 --> 13:58.170
I was pretty excited
when you asked me out for a meal.

13:58.671 --> 14:00.589
I mean, I was curious what you wanted.

14:02.633 --> 14:05.052
I must say, this is a surprise.

14:05.886 --> 14:07.054
What do you mean with it?

14:07.137 --> 14:08.597
It doesn't mean much.

14:09.807 --> 14:12.268
It's like a fruit basket.
I didn't want to come empty-handed.

14:12.351 --> 14:14.687
I asked Gyeong-tae for your info and such.

14:14.770 --> 14:16.397
I hope you're not uncomfortable.

14:16.480 --> 14:19.149
I'm not uncomfortable, just nervous.

14:20.150 --> 14:22.403
This is definitely my style, sir.

14:23.529 --> 14:24.530
[chuckles]

14:26.365 --> 14:27.658
You know Moon Dong-eun?

14:28.158 --> 14:29.910
-[Hye-jeong coughs]
-[cup clatters]

14:33.873 --> 14:37.501
To be exact, I'd like you to tell me about
the relationship between my wife and her.

14:39.837 --> 14:42.840
Wait, how do you even know Moon Dong-eun?

14:43.883 --> 14:44.967
We play Go together.

14:47.136 --> 14:48.888
Wow. [laughs]

14:49.471 --> 14:52.141
Wow. It's a small world, isn't it?

14:53.225 --> 14:55.144
Does Yeon-jin know you're meeting me?

14:55.227 --> 14:57.479
No, I don't plan on telling her.

15:04.570 --> 15:07.573
There's really not much to say
about Yeon-jin and Dong-eun.

15:08.407 --> 15:10.242
We all went to the same high school,

15:10.326 --> 15:13.162
and Yeon-jin bullied
Dong-eun a lot back in the day.

15:18.083 --> 15:21.795
Was this bullying violent?

15:21.879 --> 15:24.757
It wasn't just violent, okay?
It was way more.

15:28.177 --> 15:29.011
How bad?

15:30.346 --> 15:31.263
Really bad.

15:31.972 --> 15:33.974
[sweeping, dramatic music playing]

15:46.403 --> 15:50.282
We're in the same homeroom,
but we've never spoken.

15:50.366 --> 15:51.492
Right, Dong-eun?

15:52.660 --> 15:53.827
What do you need from me?

15:53.911 --> 15:55.704
You won't say hi back?

15:56.372 --> 15:57.373
Okay, then.

15:57.873 --> 15:59.291
I don't need anything.

15:59.375 --> 16:02.795
Except I really don't like
the smell of bleach, so do me a favor.

16:03.963 --> 16:06.715
Because it's already my turn
to clean the bathroom again.

16:08.342 --> 16:09.426
Okay?

16:10.469 --> 16:11.303
Wait, what?

16:11.387 --> 16:14.306
[chuckles] You know exactly what I mean.

16:15.224 --> 16:18.268
Does it hurt your pride less
if you don't answer right away?

16:19.603 --> 16:23.273
Anyway, can you just go ahead
and clean the bathroom for me?

16:23.857 --> 16:26.318
Another friend of mine
used to help me do that until last week,

16:26.402 --> 16:27.736
but she transferred.

16:28.487 --> 16:29.488
So-hee transferred?

16:29.571 --> 16:30.406
I guess.

16:30.906 --> 16:31.907
[grunts]

16:32.741 --> 16:35.119
Now I guess we have to find out
wherever that girl went.

16:35.202 --> 16:36.495
[Yeon-jin] Come on, answer me.

16:36.578 --> 16:39.373
I really want to hear your voice,
Dong-eun. Come on.

16:41.250 --> 16:42.668
What will you do if I…

16:44.753 --> 16:45.879
if I say no to you?

16:45.963 --> 16:46.964
[slap echoes]

16:47.047 --> 16:49.174
I like when people answer immediately.

16:49.258 --> 16:50.342
I don't like to wait.

16:50.426 --> 16:51.385
So, what?

16:52.177 --> 16:53.137
You won't do it?

16:53.220 --> 16:56.056
[music swells]

16:57.391 --> 16:58.392
Hmm.

16:59.768 --> 17:00.936
This won't do.

17:02.688 --> 17:03.522
Hey, Myeong-o.

17:04.106 --> 17:05.983
You can't even wait one minute?

17:07.568 --> 17:09.069
[Yeon-jin titters]

17:12.865 --> 17:14.450
[Hye-jeong] That was how it started.

17:17.745 --> 17:19.997
It ended with Dong-eun
dropping out of school.

17:20.080 --> 17:21.248
[sighs]

17:21.331 --> 17:23.459
You can hear the rest from Yeon-jin.

17:24.376 --> 17:25.878
It's a pretty searing story.

17:29.339 --> 17:31.592
So Dong-eun wasn't
the first one this happened to?

17:32.801 --> 17:36.180
Sounds like you and your wife
don't talk much. [chuckles]

17:36.263 --> 17:37.681
So, try it out today.

17:38.724 --> 17:39.975
I've got to get going.

17:43.979 --> 17:45.731
Can I ask you for a small favor?

17:47.066 --> 17:48.609
When you see Moon Dong-eun,

17:48.692 --> 17:51.445
can you please tell her
I told you all this stuff?

17:53.072 --> 17:54.073
Thank you.

17:59.661 --> 18:01.455
[mysterious music playing]

18:01.538 --> 18:03.207
Is that the only gambling you do?

18:04.750 --> 18:07.294
One time,
I bet my whole life on something.

18:08.045 --> 18:08.879
Did you win?

18:10.380 --> 18:11.215
I plan to.

18:16.887 --> 18:18.013
[exhales heavily]

18:19.890 --> 18:21.350
[tiles shuffling, clacking]

18:29.066 --> 18:30.067
[bystander] Ah!

18:30.859 --> 18:31.819
Oh, come on.

18:31.902 --> 18:34.196
Don't try so hard to beat an old man.

18:34.738 --> 18:37.157
You should let him go again.
One more game.

18:37.866 --> 18:39.910
He can redo his last move, right?

18:39.993 --> 18:43.080
[bystander 2] He's very skilled
for someone so young, huh?

18:43.163 --> 18:44.414
[Yeo-jeong] Sure.

18:44.998 --> 18:47.126
Well, sadly, I've lost this match, sir.

18:47.209 --> 18:48.210
[player chuckles]

18:49.044 --> 18:49.878
Here you go.

18:51.505 --> 18:52.589
I have to meet a friend.

18:54.550 --> 18:55.551
There you are.

18:57.219 --> 18:58.053
Let's go.

19:00.139 --> 19:00.973
I'm your friend?

19:01.056 --> 19:03.892
-[bystander 1] Sure.
-[bystander 2] Who's playing?

19:03.976 --> 19:07.062
Please help me out.
I played three rounds against four people.

19:25.789 --> 19:28.667
Does your wife get annoyed
when you come here and play Go?

19:29.501 --> 19:31.211
I'm sure I annoy her often.

19:35.174 --> 19:36.175
Do they still sell those?

19:37.426 --> 19:42.181
Oh. I got an invitation from someone,
so I brought it. I hope she could like it.

19:42.264 --> 19:44.600
[chuckles] You two are adorable.

19:47.895 --> 19:48.937
[Do-yeong exhales]

19:52.065 --> 19:54.735
I guess you have
a real friend you want to hear from.

19:56.445 --> 19:58.322
I have an important call to make.

19:58.405 --> 20:00.157
But I need to organize my thoughts.

20:07.164 --> 20:08.248
Do you live nearby?

20:08.832 --> 20:11.001
Oh, I just moved here, pretty recently.

20:11.793 --> 20:13.962
[Do-yeong] Semyeong is a good choice.

20:14.046 --> 20:15.923
The air is still nice around here.

20:16.924 --> 20:20.135
[Yeo-jeong] Oh, I didn't move here
for any logical reasons.

20:20.802 --> 20:22.387
I need to get revenge for someone.

20:24.556 --> 20:25.974
[laughs]

20:26.058 --> 20:27.976
Revenge in South Korea?

20:28.060 --> 20:30.646
That won't be easy. You can't use a gun.

20:32.814 --> 20:35.442
Although about half the country
knows how to shoot one, don't they?

20:37.861 --> 20:39.363
You can use knives, can't you?

20:40.948 --> 20:43.075
You need to get up close and personal,

20:43.158 --> 20:45.452
so you feel it as you go in.

20:46.703 --> 20:48.872
You need to be so close to the person

20:48.956 --> 20:52.459
that you see your eyes
reflected in theirs, and--

20:52.542 --> 20:53.794
[clack echoing]

21:00.759 --> 21:02.761
Oh! I'm sorry!

21:03.637 --> 21:07.307
I've been watching Netflix all day
because I don't have any patients.

21:08.684 --> 21:09.518
Right.

21:11.103 --> 21:13.355
I opened up a practice.
You should drop by.

21:14.189 --> 21:17.359
I have a lot of male patients too,
so don't feel uncomfortable.

21:19.236 --> 21:20.153
Best of luck.

21:20.237 --> 21:22.656
[sighs] Just hope I can pay rent.

21:23.240 --> 21:24.074
Your revenge.

21:25.117 --> 21:25.951
Ah.

21:27.286 --> 21:29.413
I'll definitely need some of that as well.

21:33.000 --> 21:34.334
[Yeo-jeong] He was pretty tall.

21:35.502 --> 21:39.548
About 179 centimeters, and 77 kilograms.

21:40.340 --> 21:42.050
[Dong-eun] You're tall too.

21:43.218 --> 21:45.095
I wish I were the only tall guy here.

21:47.264 --> 21:49.850
His watch, his shoes, his cologne…

21:51.727 --> 21:54.396
They were all just right.
Not too much or too little.

21:54.896 --> 21:55.897
It was like

21:57.107 --> 22:00.193
opening to the 17th page
of the January issue of GQ.

22:03.905 --> 22:06.074
[sighs, chuckles]

22:06.158 --> 22:08.952
So, my mom and dad were always
weird about my birthday.

22:09.453 --> 22:11.079
And it's on January 16th.

22:11.163 --> 22:14.333
They always said it was hard
to figure out what to get me,

22:14.416 --> 22:15.959
so senior year of high school,

22:17.044 --> 22:21.006
they told me they'd pick something
on the 16th page of GQ every January.

22:22.924 --> 22:26.219
Sometimes a book,
sometimes a coffee machine.

22:26.303 --> 22:28.847
And sometimes,
I even got a sports car out of it.

22:30.349 --> 22:34.269
But I still don't understand
why that makes him the 17th page.

22:35.771 --> 22:39.232
When you flip to the 16th page,
you can always see the 17th page too.

22:40.108 --> 22:42.527
Sometimes, you find
something even better on that page.

22:43.862 --> 22:45.989
So, what I'm saying is this.

22:46.073 --> 22:49.326
I was annoyed
because he was so cool, okay?

22:49.409 --> 22:51.078
Making myself look like an idiot.

22:51.578 --> 22:53.580
-[chuckles]
-[Yeo-jeong munching]

23:01.922 --> 23:02.923
Did you get a call?

23:04.216 --> 23:08.303
Not yet. I thought he'd call me
after the parent observation class,

23:08.387 --> 23:10.222
but no, he hasn't called yet.

23:11.223 --> 23:14.810
He probably doesn't like it right now
because he has no control over it.

23:15.477 --> 23:17.312
He just seemed like that type.

23:19.314 --> 23:21.066
I bet he'll reach out on Friday,

23:21.149 --> 23:24.444
after he finishes up with his work,
cancels all of his plans,

23:24.945 --> 23:28.365
and rehearses his questions for you
in his head. Then he'll call you.

23:45.424 --> 23:49.052
So, where have you been all day?
You weren't answering my texts.

23:51.721 --> 23:52.722
Where's Ye-sol?

23:54.349 --> 23:55.934
Don't you know what time it is?

23:57.227 --> 23:58.520
Maybe I should learn

23:59.271 --> 24:01.106
how to play Go too.

24:01.189 --> 24:02.190
You think?

24:03.650 --> 24:05.193
Let me ask you something.

24:06.111 --> 24:06.945
[Yeon-jin] Huh?

24:07.654 --> 24:10.490
Are you friends with Ye-sol's teacher?

24:13.034 --> 24:16.329
Is she the teacher
you told me you don't like?

24:17.289 --> 24:18.290
[chuckles]

24:19.291 --> 24:21.293
I heard you went to observe the class.

24:21.376 --> 24:25.881
You know, she misunderstood
something about me.

24:27.466 --> 24:30.469
As you probably saw,
she and I are from different worlds.

24:31.678 --> 24:35.182
But we talked about it, and it's fine.
Why? What'd she say?

24:36.766 --> 24:37.976
She should have said something?

24:39.478 --> 24:41.313
[Do-yeong exhales]

24:41.396 --> 24:42.647
How did you talk it out?

24:44.024 --> 24:47.694
You called her a crazy bitch
when you first told me.

24:49.196 --> 24:50.822
Did you mean she might try to hurt Ye-sol?

24:50.906 --> 24:52.616
So you wanted to send her abroad?

24:56.077 --> 24:57.162
Baby.

24:58.538 --> 25:01.166
We dated for two years
and have been married for ten.

25:01.249 --> 25:02.751
That's 12 years in total.

25:03.251 --> 25:04.377
And after all that time,

25:04.461 --> 25:06.588
you have to trust me
that everything will be fine.

25:07.172 --> 25:09.090
Don't scold me like that, you know?

25:10.634 --> 25:13.345
No matter what you've heard
or what anyone says to you,

25:13.428 --> 25:14.763
do not listen to them.

25:14.846 --> 25:16.473
[ominous music playing]

25:17.349 --> 25:19.601
You know, whenever you choose something,

25:20.352 --> 25:24.189
you always choose the thing
that's more appealing and shinier,

25:24.272 --> 25:25.148
don't you?

25:25.649 --> 25:27.484
Our marriage is one of those things.

25:28.443 --> 25:29.819
You like my body,

25:29.903 --> 25:31.279
you like my voice,

25:31.780 --> 25:32.989
the jokes I make,

25:33.073 --> 25:34.407
my background.

25:35.200 --> 25:36.451
You like all of it.

25:38.119 --> 25:41.039
So don't try to open a box
that should stay closed up.

25:44.042 --> 25:45.669
I love you so much, babe.

25:46.878 --> 25:49.130
I don't want you
to find out about this, okay?

25:50.632 --> 25:54.678
I'll make sure that nothing inside
that box comes out into the world.

25:54.761 --> 25:56.888
And I'll make sure that Ye-sol stays safe.

25:57.639 --> 25:58.974
So come on, baby.

25:59.933 --> 26:05.021
Can you just let me and Ye-sol
shine like we do now, huh?

26:05.605 --> 26:06.606
Please, honey?

26:10.902 --> 26:13.154
I promise this box isn't shiny at all.

26:13.780 --> 26:14.781
[music intensifies]

26:16.992 --> 26:17.993
[music trails off]

26:18.076 --> 26:19.077
[door opening]

26:27.127 --> 26:28.378
[woman 1] I'm so jealous.

26:32.257 --> 26:35.093
[quirky, mysterious music playing]

26:35.844 --> 26:37.971
[woman 2] I shouldn't even be eating stew.

26:38.054 --> 26:40.015
The shaman told me
to lose three kilograms.

26:40.098 --> 26:42.892
[woman 1] Why? I thought
you just needed compatible fortunes.

26:42.976 --> 26:44.394
That's 'cause you're skinny.

26:45.437 --> 26:48.189
I still haven't found a good guy,
even if I'm skinny.

26:48.273 --> 26:50.692
It must be nice to have
such a good fortune.

26:50.775 --> 26:54.279
Isn't that old guy you matched with,
like, very lucky and fortunate?

26:55.655 --> 26:58.074
Well… I guess it's not that bad.

26:59.659 --> 27:02.370
I have earth in my fortunes,
but I think he doesn't.

27:03.163 --> 27:05.498
[woman 1] So that's important too?
That's so cool.

27:06.416 --> 27:08.043
I wonder what my fortunes are.

27:09.502 --> 27:10.420
[music trails off]

27:10.503 --> 27:12.547
[woman] Thank you so much.

27:12.631 --> 27:14.924
-Hi there.
-Thanks, have a good day.

27:20.513 --> 27:24.267
That scar is taking some time to heal.
It's been a while, right?

27:24.351 --> 27:25.727
Want a new Band-Aid?

27:28.355 --> 27:30.982
Just don't get any more
sponsored products from them.

27:31.900 --> 27:33.610
My feet are getting all scratched!

27:34.527 --> 27:35.737
[phone chimes]

27:41.159 --> 27:43.286
[Jae-jun] Come out.
I'm in the parking lot.

27:46.706 --> 27:49.042
What are you even talking about?

27:49.125 --> 27:50.877
-Just end it.
-Just end what?

27:50.960 --> 27:52.170
Just end it with your husband.

27:53.672 --> 27:55.465
I want to be Ye-sol's father.

27:56.508 --> 27:57.676
And you'll get a new husband.

27:58.843 --> 28:00.095
[scoffs]

28:00.178 --> 28:03.348
You're fucking insane. Is this why
you showed up at Ye-sol's school?

28:03.431 --> 28:04.849
Don't change the subject.

28:06.976 --> 28:08.269
Do you really love him?

28:08.770 --> 28:10.980
You and your husband
can't even talk about Dong-eun.

28:11.481 --> 28:14.401
You don't even know if Do-yeong
will take your side or not.

28:15.068 --> 28:19.030
Oh, or maybe you don't talk about it
because you know he won't take your side.

28:20.824 --> 28:22.033
But I know all about it.

28:23.034 --> 28:25.120
And I've still always been there for you.

28:26.121 --> 28:27.205
Right here.

28:28.873 --> 28:29.958
Isn't this love?

28:30.834 --> 28:32.669
[unsettling music playing]

28:32.752 --> 28:34.003
Is that love to you?

28:34.713 --> 28:35.547
Yeah.

28:36.423 --> 28:38.174
Even if we didn't know it's love.

28:40.719 --> 28:41.720
Don't you think?

28:44.055 --> 28:45.056
I guess.

28:47.225 --> 28:49.561
You know, I've never actually
thought about it.

28:50.061 --> 28:52.147
I love you so much, babe.

28:52.230 --> 28:54.482
I don't want you
to find out about this, okay?

28:54.566 --> 28:55.567
[music intensifies]

28:58.653 --> 28:59.654
[chuckles]

29:00.655 --> 29:02.157
Right? So, why don't we--

29:02.240 --> 29:03.908
Oh, I really do, though.

29:06.119 --> 29:07.746
I really love him, you know.

29:11.624 --> 29:12.876
I've loved him all along.

29:16.588 --> 29:17.589
[scoffs]

29:22.177 --> 29:24.304
[Dong-eun] If I'm being honest, Yeon-jin,

29:24.387 --> 29:26.931
I find myself smiling recently,

29:27.432 --> 29:29.517
imagining the future.

29:29.601 --> 29:33.438
Myeong-o never left the country,
and nobody can reach him.

29:34.606 --> 29:36.274
Maybe everything happening now

29:37.150 --> 29:39.486
will finally lead to your true confession.

29:42.238 --> 29:43.990
Maybe all this cover-up

29:44.073 --> 29:45.742
is trying to hide something else.

29:46.242 --> 29:49.245
Something that will
make all this even worse.

29:55.001 --> 29:58.254
[housekeeper] Here you go, ma'am.
The hydrogen peroxide is inside.

29:58.338 --> 29:59.672
Have you been hurt?

30:00.381 --> 30:01.883
Just leave it here and go.

30:01.966 --> 30:02.967
Of course.

30:10.391 --> 30:15.688
[Dong-eun] I've been so excited thinking
that maybe by covering up your tracks,

30:15.772 --> 30:19.442
you've now opened Pandora's box.

30:20.944 --> 30:23.029
[phone ringing]

30:23.112 --> 30:24.864
CHIEF SHIN YEONG-JUN

30:27.408 --> 30:28.243
Yes, hello?

30:28.743 --> 30:30.829
Do you have some time tomorrow afternoon?

30:31.579 --> 30:33.665
I have a few things that you asked for.

30:36.876 --> 30:38.878
[music swells, fades away]

30:40.672 --> 30:43.091
[Yeong-jun] I have everything
after she dropped out of school.

30:43.174 --> 30:45.802
Worked at the factory,
all the way up to Semyeong Elementary.

30:45.885 --> 30:48.763
And it's all clean.
No fines, no unpaid insurance bills.

30:48.847 --> 30:49.848
[scoffs]

30:51.099 --> 30:52.851
She's a model citizen.

30:54.060 --> 30:56.145
What about her mother? Where is she?

30:56.229 --> 30:57.730
Jeong Mi-hui?

30:57.814 --> 30:59.148
You need that too?

30:59.732 --> 31:01.943
It worked pretty well in high school.

31:02.694 --> 31:03.820
The poorer you are…

31:06.072 --> 31:07.907
the more harmful your family is.

31:08.408 --> 31:11.828
PREPARATION TIME
15:00-17:00

31:15.540 --> 31:16.541
[laughs]

31:19.377 --> 31:21.546
[somber music playing]

31:29.470 --> 31:30.889
[cackles]

31:36.895 --> 31:38.938
[Yeo-jeong] By the way,
who was in that picture?

31:40.857 --> 31:43.693
I could recognize most of them
after you explained to me,

31:44.652 --> 31:45.778
but I couldn't recognize her.

31:47.447 --> 31:50.450
The woman on the left,
the one who was wearing the red apron?

31:50.533 --> 31:52.535
[somber music continuing]

31:54.579 --> 31:55.580
That's my mom.

31:58.166 --> 32:02.003
You want to know what her picture's
doing there with the perpetrators?

32:03.755 --> 32:07.425
[clears throat] Well,
can I ask you something else?

32:07.508 --> 32:10.136
Uh, do you wash your sheets often?

32:11.429 --> 32:12.972
[Dong-eun chuckles wryly] Yeah.

32:13.973 --> 32:14.974
[Yeo-jeong] Mmm.

32:16.976 --> 32:19.896
Can I ask you a question too?

32:19.979 --> 32:23.066
Ah. So you want to know
something about me now?

32:23.566 --> 32:24.400
Like what?

32:25.443 --> 32:28.613
3-7-2-4. Why is that your door code?

32:30.448 --> 32:33.743
Usually, it's a birthday
or a license number,

32:33.826 --> 32:36.621
or sometimes the day
you first met someone.

32:37.538 --> 32:39.624
But I can't figure out what yours is.

32:45.588 --> 32:47.757
Can I persuade you to ask something else?

33:05.984 --> 33:07.902
[guard] 3724, you have a visitor.

33:09.278 --> 33:11.280
[suspenseful music playing]

33:15.660 --> 33:16.995
I'm very sorry, ma'am.

33:18.997 --> 33:20.832
After staying here for a while,

33:22.583 --> 33:26.421
I've realized I did something terrible,
and no matter how…

33:27.005 --> 33:30.842
no matter how many times I apologize,
I know that my sin won't be forgiven.

33:30.925 --> 33:32.927
And I can't undo what I've done.

33:34.387 --> 33:35.555
I did not know.

33:37.098 --> 33:38.016
What?

33:38.099 --> 33:39.225
I didn't know…

33:41.227 --> 33:43.104
that a murderous monster like you

33:43.730 --> 33:46.149
had been sending letters
directly to my son

33:47.775 --> 33:48.943
this entire time.

33:49.944 --> 33:51.988
Yes. I was mentally unstable, and I--

33:52.071 --> 33:54.449
Didn't manage to withstand
the social pressures

33:54.532 --> 33:56.534
and made an unfortunate mistake?

33:58.327 --> 34:01.539
Don't give me that bullshit.
Your letters all say the same thing.

34:03.291 --> 34:05.293
Yes, I did. [stifles laugh]

34:08.129 --> 34:11.007
I, uh… I'm not very good at writing.

34:11.090 --> 34:12.675
Shut your goddamned mouth!

34:12.759 --> 34:17.055
How dare you? You're messing with my son
to get a reduced sentence, you asshole.

34:17.722 --> 34:19.974
How could you dare
send him back to that hell?

34:21.059 --> 34:23.394
A man like you will never be forgiven.

34:23.478 --> 34:25.813
So if you ever send my son a letter again…

34:27.815 --> 34:28.858
I will kill you.

34:32.987 --> 34:34.155
But you're a doctor.

34:36.199 --> 34:37.200
What?

34:37.283 --> 34:39.285
[suspenseful music playing]

34:42.997 --> 34:45.583
Your family are all doctors.

34:46.751 --> 34:48.544
None of you can kill people.

34:50.129 --> 34:53.925
I mean, your husband got killed
because he agreed to an oath like that.

34:54.008 --> 34:55.009
[music intensifies]

34:56.552 --> 34:58.763
I'm not doing this
because I want to get out.

34:58.846 --> 35:00.306
I've grown to like it here.

35:01.682 --> 35:03.226
They give me three meals every day,

35:03.309 --> 35:06.020
and I get to have fresh air
and medical attention too.

35:06.604 --> 35:10.483
Then why'd you
send my son those letters, huh?

35:11.818 --> 35:13.319
Because I was bored.

35:20.326 --> 35:22.328
So your poor son really went to hell?

35:22.411 --> 35:24.413
[screams]

35:24.497 --> 35:26.082
You son of a bitch!

35:26.165 --> 35:30.253
[screaming, pounding on divider]

35:30.336 --> 35:31.337
[fizzing]

35:38.803 --> 35:39.804
[sighs heavily]

35:50.106 --> 35:52.108
HA YE-SOL

35:55.528 --> 35:56.529
[sighs]

36:05.121 --> 36:06.706
[phone ringing]

36:17.133 --> 36:19.135
[ringing continues]

36:22.430 --> 36:23.264
Hello?

36:27.351 --> 36:28.186
Where?

36:29.228 --> 36:30.646
Jongno Station?

36:31.647 --> 36:34.734
Who was it? You? Or you?

36:34.817 --> 36:36.819
Who the fuck reported Myeong-o missing?!

36:38.487 --> 36:39.655
Maybe Yeon-jin?

36:40.448 --> 36:42.575
She said to report it, so…

36:43.075 --> 36:45.286
She would never do something that stupid.

36:46.621 --> 36:48.122
That leaves you. Was it?

36:48.706 --> 36:52.460
[sighs] I got the call first
'cause I'm his boss, but he's an adult.

36:52.543 --> 36:54.962
They'll categorize him
as a runaway at most.

36:55.046 --> 36:56.964
The special forces
aren't gonna come running

36:57.048 --> 37:00.301
just because some 36-year-old man
isn't picking up his calls, Sa-ra.

37:00.384 --> 37:03.763
So it was you.
You started looking for Myeong-o first.

37:03.846 --> 37:04.931
You think it's me?

37:05.598 --> 37:07.975
What about you? Why are you not a suspect?

37:09.769 --> 37:10.853
It's you.

37:11.979 --> 37:15.399
It was you. [chuckles]
Of course it was, you bitch.

37:15.983 --> 37:17.652
Should I call the cops and check?

37:23.157 --> 37:24.784
It was me. You're right.

37:25.451 --> 37:26.452
I reported it.

37:27.161 --> 37:28.329
But who cares?

37:29.497 --> 37:31.374
You said he could've died somewhere.

37:31.874 --> 37:33.751
What if he's actually dead right now?

37:34.794 --> 37:37.672
Am I really the weird one here
for reporting him missing?

37:38.464 --> 37:42.218
-He lives alone, aren't you worried?
-This fucking bitch is crazy.

37:43.594 --> 37:46.013
Since when have you
cared so much about Myeong-o?

37:46.847 --> 37:50.726
Oh, it makes more sense
why he asked you out.

37:51.477 --> 37:53.729
[chuckles] Did you sleep with him too?

37:53.813 --> 37:55.064
Huh? Huh?

37:55.147 --> 37:56.983
What the fuck are you even saying?

37:57.066 --> 37:58.484
He asked her out?

37:59.068 --> 38:00.611
-[blow landing]
-[Hye-jeong yelps]

38:00.695 --> 38:03.322
Your vagina has always been
shared property, right?

38:03.823 --> 38:06.534
[Sa-ra] Hey, you did it on purpose,
didn't you? What do you want?

38:07.201 --> 38:08.869
You know I bought drugs from him

38:08.953 --> 38:12.123
and got prescriptions under his name
for a few years, don't you?

38:12.206 --> 38:13.708
You're aware of that?

38:13.791 --> 38:16.711
When they start investigating,
I'll be the first one they'll catch,

38:16.794 --> 38:19.130
so why the fuck did you make that report?

38:19.213 --> 38:20.548
God, TMI, ladies.

38:21.757 --> 38:23.551
-I'm leaving.
-[Hye-jeong] Let go.

38:24.051 --> 38:25.428
Let go now!

38:25.511 --> 38:27.096
Let me fucking go!

38:27.179 --> 38:30.850
Listen. If any of the cops
start calling me,

38:30.933 --> 38:33.644
then I'm really going to fucking kill you,

38:33.728 --> 38:35.396
you stupid bitch!

38:38.607 --> 38:40.609
EARLY MORNING DELIVERY

38:40.693 --> 38:43.529
-[Dong-eun unzipping bag]
-What is this? Is it kimchi?

38:44.905 --> 38:45.990
It's not.

38:48.659 --> 38:49.910
[Hyeon-nam gasps]

38:49.994 --> 38:53.914
Deposit the won and dollars separately,
and get proof of your average balance.

38:53.998 --> 38:57.710
What… What is all of this?

38:59.879 --> 39:01.339
Did you get a passport for Sun-a?

39:01.422 --> 39:03.632
Huh? Oh.

39:03.716 --> 39:05.634
Uh, it's here…

39:07.428 --> 39:09.263
Why do you need a passport?

39:11.265 --> 39:14.643
This is for the study agency.
Please sign these papers.

39:18.522 --> 39:20.691
I'm going to send Sun-a to study abroad.

39:23.235 --> 39:24.320
Abroad?

39:25.112 --> 39:27.198
I'm trying to start the rest of my plans.

39:27.907 --> 39:31.827
I'll do what you asked, as soon as
she gets to leave the country safely.

39:31.911 --> 39:33.079
[breathing shakily]

39:33.162 --> 39:34.914
In the United States,

39:35.790 --> 39:37.958
she will hear the news about her father.

39:38.042 --> 39:40.044
[sweeping, dramatic music builds]

39:40.127 --> 39:41.879
[breathing shakily]

39:41.962 --> 39:42.963
I lied to you.

39:44.507 --> 39:47.385
You won't get to have
a lovely dinner together.

39:49.595 --> 39:52.890
You're going to lose Sun-a if we do this.

39:55.726 --> 39:57.603
But I promise that Sun-a will be safe

39:59.021 --> 40:00.648
from her father who beats her

40:02.108 --> 40:05.653
and her mother who wants him killed.

40:10.950 --> 40:13.077
That's the reality of what we're planning.

40:15.579 --> 40:16.580
If you want to stop,

40:18.249 --> 40:19.667
then tell me now, please.

40:31.303 --> 40:34.849
EDEN APARTMENTS

40:34.932 --> 40:36.684
[Yeon-jin]
Is this really the right address?

40:37.351 --> 40:38.602
This is where she lives?

40:39.186 --> 40:40.146
Yeah. It is.

40:40.771 --> 40:44.066
She was reported to have moved in
before Semyeong Elementary. Why?

40:44.150 --> 40:45.276
[scoffs]

40:45.359 --> 40:47.153
This is really the place where…

40:49.155 --> 40:50.239
that bitch is living?

40:50.322 --> 40:52.450
UNIT 301, EDEN APARTMENTS
71 SEMYEONG STREET, SEMYEONG

40:52.533 --> 40:53.951
71 SEMYEONG STREET

40:54.034 --> 40:56.036
[tense music playing]

40:57.663 --> 40:59.290
It's right in front of my house.

40:59.373 --> 41:01.375
[music intensifies]

41:25.483 --> 41:27.485
[phone trills, rings]

41:29.904 --> 41:32.948
-[assistant] Good evening, sir.
-A personal matter's come up.

41:34.074 --> 41:36.744
Cancel everything.
Clear my schedule till Tuesday.

41:38.245 --> 41:40.498
And text me if anything urgent comes up.

41:40.581 --> 41:42.208
Yes, sir, right away.

41:42.291 --> 41:44.001
-Do you need anything else?
-That'll be all.

41:45.044 --> 41:46.045
[line disconnects]

41:49.798 --> 41:50.799
[phone trills]

41:51.800 --> 41:53.177
[line ringing]

41:54.261 --> 41:55.513
[line connects]

41:55.596 --> 41:56.597
Where are you?

41:58.015 --> 41:59.141
Let's meet somewhere.

42:11.987 --> 42:12.988
[music trails off]

42:13.531 --> 42:15.032
[footsteps approaching]

42:23.374 --> 42:24.375
[Dong-eun sighs]

42:27.127 --> 42:28.879
How much can I win per house?

42:31.131 --> 42:32.132
Heh.

42:34.593 --> 42:37.596
You must have a lot of questions.
So, go for it.

42:40.975 --> 42:42.518
Aren't you cold? Your clothes look thin.

42:46.272 --> 42:49.733
I thought your first question would be
if I approached you on purpose.

42:49.817 --> 42:52.319
Well, I wanted to be
unpredictable for once.

42:55.906 --> 42:57.616
What would you have done
if I hadn't called?

42:58.200 --> 42:59.868
Held a parent teacher conference.

42:59.952 --> 43:01.704
What if I'd made a complaint against you?

43:01.787 --> 43:04.456
It's a private school,
and I'm influential.

43:04.540 --> 43:05.541
I know.

43:06.584 --> 43:08.210
I know all about your influence.

43:09.128 --> 43:10.588
I'm depending on it.

43:16.760 --> 43:19.930
The man who taught me
how to play Go was a lawyer who said to me

43:20.556 --> 43:23.726
that I was born holding the black stone,
and it was easy for me.

43:25.185 --> 43:27.771
So I've always held
a certain advantage over others.

43:29.148 --> 43:30.482
But this match right here…

43:33.277 --> 43:34.445
is a tough one.

43:35.446 --> 43:37.323
[low, mysterious music playing]

43:42.119 --> 43:44.038
I have questions for you and Yeon-jin.

43:45.164 --> 43:48.751
But… I want to hear you out here first.

43:51.462 --> 43:52.379
But why?

43:53.547 --> 43:55.549
Because you claim you're a victim.

43:58.218 --> 44:00.220
[menacing music builds]

44:25.746 --> 44:26.747
[chuckles wryly]

44:32.753 --> 44:34.171
[phone ringing]

44:40.344 --> 44:41.845
Oh, are you here already?

44:42.846 --> 44:44.181
Yeah. Unit 301.

44:45.724 --> 44:47.851
How long will it take to unlock this door?

44:56.110 --> 44:58.112
This is illegal, by the way.

44:58.195 --> 45:01.740
If it were legal, you wouldn't get this.

45:05.035 --> 45:07.579
Are you… on TV?

45:07.663 --> 45:09.957
The weathercaster? Park Yeon-jin?

45:10.541 --> 45:14.253
If I was, do you think
this agreement might change?

45:31.645 --> 45:33.647
[dark, intense music playing]

46:27.117 --> 46:29.953
Open it. And then wait here for me.

46:30.621 --> 46:31.455
What?

46:33.123 --> 46:34.374
Ugh, fine.

46:35.793 --> 46:36.627
[door unlocks]

46:38.128 --> 46:39.797
You went to school with Yeon-jin.

46:41.340 --> 46:43.091
So, did you approach me on purpose?

46:44.343 --> 46:45.177
Yeah.

46:48.972 --> 46:49.807
Does that mean…

46:52.100 --> 46:53.811
you learned to play Go on purpose?

46:55.813 --> 46:57.105
That's how it started.

46:58.106 --> 46:59.483
But then I really liked it.

47:00.818 --> 47:03.487
In the game of Go, you're building houses.

47:03.987 --> 47:07.449
I had dreamed of being an architect
until I had to leave school.

47:16.208 --> 47:18.293
Were you also the one who sent me this?

47:19.127 --> 47:21.588
I made sure to pick out
the ones you look good in.

47:22.214 --> 47:23.215
It doesn't look like it.

47:25.175 --> 47:26.343
So, where do you live?

47:27.427 --> 47:30.347
If you approached me,
you must live pretty close by, right?

47:33.141 --> 47:34.476
I've braced myself.

47:38.355 --> 47:39.857
Even if you've done that,

47:39.940 --> 47:42.109
cruelty like this hurts a lot.

47:44.528 --> 47:45.529
I know that well.

47:47.239 --> 47:48.240
[lighter clinks]

47:48.949 --> 47:50.951
[dramatic music playing]

47:58.584 --> 48:02.045
[inhales, exhales]

48:04.298 --> 48:05.632
I slipped up.

48:09.386 --> 48:11.680
I really shouldn't have
bullied that bitch.

48:15.434 --> 48:17.436
I should have just killed her back then.

48:29.156 --> 48:30.157
[music halts]

48:34.077 --> 48:35.245
[resounding click]

48:35.329 --> 48:38.749
[sweeping, intricate music building]

48:51.762 --> 48:53.263
YOON SO-HEE, FEMALE
AGE 18

49:03.315 --> 49:04.483
PROCESSED ON 12/15/2004

49:52.322 --> 49:54.408
[music intensifies]

50:10.716 --> 50:12.718
[music trails off]

50:19.266 --> 50:21.268
[dark, brooding pop song playing]
